  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped celery and cook until it is tender.",
    "Add the canned diced tomatoes, vegetable broth, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the crumbly feta cheese until it is well combined.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley."
